Z||000001||88CoupeV6||07-24-2001||06:47 PM||||There is NEFA, We are going to a show in NH this Saturday. We also just had our swap meet at Kick Hill Farm in Lebanon CT 2 weeks ago. Check out our web page at <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com." TARGET=_blank>www.fieropride.com.</A>  We have about 100 members and we always have a lot of fun and a friendly group. We also have an outstanding fall cruise. We goto many events around New England. We also have a great newsletter. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <FONT COLOR="#ff0000">Click on pics under my signature to see pictures from lots of our events.</FONT> Hope to see you aboard soon. I know you would love it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
